--- Comment #2 from Grant Edwards <grant.b.edwards@gmail.com>  2010-03-16 20:27:47 UTC ---
I'm using an external gcc 4.4.3 toolchain that is built using
buildroot-2010.2.

Apparently your toolchain can find files like crt1.o without the
--sysroot option.  The 4.4.3 toolchain that is built by buildroot
can't.  It appears that the 4.3 toolchain built by older versions of
buildroot didn't always require the --sysroot option.

Is the patch that adds --sysroot to the LDFLAGS going to cause
problems for toolchains generated by crosstool-ng?

